sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Member
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Storage
  participant Q as Redis queue
  participant K as Worker
  participant M as AI layer

  U->>W: choose file, optional job description
  W->>A: POST /api/resumes multipart
  A->>A: sniff bytes, extract text, refuse scans
  A->>DB: check slot and runs, charge 1 run
  A->>S: put resumes/user/id/original.ext
  A->>DB: insert resume + analysis row processing
  A->>Q: after commit: resume-ai.run {resumeId, userId, analysis}
  A-->>W: 202 ResumeSummary
  loop every 1.5 s growing to 10 s
    W->>A: GET /api/resumes/:id/status
    A-->>W: status + component states
  end
  Q->>K: deliver job
  K->>DB: claim row (conditional UPDATE)
  K->>S: get original
  K->>M: parseDocument(text)
  K->>M: analyze(original, job)
  M-->>K: before, improved, after, cover letter
  K->>DB: one transaction: save results, mark analysis and rewrite done
  K->>DB: request interview_non_technical at cost 0
  K->>Q: resume-ai.run {interview_non_technical}
  K->>M: interview(non_technical)
  K->>DB: save groups, status analyzed
  W->>A: GET /api/resumes/:id
  A-->>W: ResumeDetail
  Note over K,DB: On failure: retry up to 3 attempts, then mark failed and refund the run
